{"id":"e1c26f82e22425ac","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-df-zfc-projective-hierarchy-level.md","title":"ZFC Projective Hierarchy Level","display":"df-zfc-projective-hierarchy-level — ZFC Projective Hierarchy Level","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-projective-hierarchy-level","aliases":["58-df-zfc-projective-hierarchy-level"],"display":"df-zfc-projective-hierarchy-level — ZFC Projective Hierarchy Level","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-projective-hierarchy]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-projective-hierarchy-level"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-projective-hierarchy-level</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-projective-hierarchy-level — ZFC Projective Hierarchy Level"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d4ac523055965e48\" href=\"?note=d4ac523055965e48\" title=\"58-df-projective-hierarchy\">58-df-projective-hierarchy</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,n\\in V\">\\(A,n\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^1_n(\\omega^\\omega)\">\\(\\Sigma^1_n(\\omega^\\omega)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi^1_n(\\omega^\\omega)\">\\(\\Pi^1_n(\\omega^\\omega)\\)</span> are the projective pointclasses on Baire space (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d4ac523055965e48\" href=\"?note=d4ac523055965e48\" title=\"58-df-projective-hierarchy\">58-df-projective-hierarchy</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProjectiveHierarchyLevel}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ProjectiveHierarchyLevel}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}projective\\text{-}hierarchy\\text{-}level} \\vdash \\mathrm{ProjectiveHierarchyLevel}_S(A,n) \\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq\\omega^\\omega\\land n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land\\bigl(A\\in\\Sigma^{1}_{n}(\\omega^\\omega)\\lor A\\in\\Pi^{1}_{n}(\\omega^\\omega)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}projective\\text{-}hierarchy\\text{-}level} \\vdash \\mathrm{ProjectiveHierarchyLevel}_S(A,n) \\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq\\omega^\\omega\\land n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land\\bigl(A\\in\\Sigma^{1}_{n}(\\omega^\\omega)\\lor A\\in\\Pi^{1}_{n}(\\omega^\\omega)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The pointclass notation and its ambient Polish space agree exactly with <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d4ac523055965e48\" href=\"?note=d4ac523055965e48\" title=\"58-df-projective-hierarchy\">58-df-projective-hierarchy</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-projective-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"d4ac523055965e48","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-projective-hierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-projective-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"d4ac523055965e48","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma^1_n(\\omega^\\omega)$ and $\\Pi^1_n(\\omega^\\omega)$ are the projective pointclasses on Baire space (see [[58-df-projective-hierarchy]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-projective-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"d4ac523055965e48","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"The pointclass notation and its ambient Polish space agree exactly with [[58-df-projective-hierarchy]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,n\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma^1_n(\\omega^\\omega)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi^1_n(\\omega^\\omega)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProjectiveHierarchyLevel}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}projective\\text{-}hierarchy\\text{-}level} \\vdash \\mathrm{ProjectiveHierarchyLevel}_S(A,n) \\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq\\omega^\\omega\\land n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land\\bigl(A\\in\\Sigma^{1}_{n}(\\omega^\\omega)\\lor A\\in\\Pi^{1}_{n}(\\omega^\\omega)\\bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1050,"backlinks":[{"id":"8c8a8e761d3e8227","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ProjectiveHierarchyLevel}_S$ (boldface projective-level predicate on $\\omega^\\omega$, see [[../batch16/58-df-zfc-projective-hierarchy-level.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3208","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-zfc-projective-hierarchy-level.md|58-df-zfc-projective-hierarchy-level]]（batch16）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","d4ac523055965e48"]}